{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269660/extras/948ebb8fe23b2fab5911f3bd7a0fcd1d.poster.avif?t=1771524089\" width=548 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269660/extras/948ebb8fe23b2fab5911f3bd7a0fcd1d.webm?t=1771524089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269660/extras/948ebb8fe23b2fab5911f3bd7a0fcd1d.mp4?t=1771524089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Starmaker Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After a crisis at work, Anna dives into Starmaker.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your support, she\u2019ll explore her sensual side, flaunt her beauty, and build her own path to fame. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269660/extras/f23835de21bcfd6cf49e5503446b4fa6.avif?t=1771524089\" width=1560 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269660/extras/e5484a1d225b70d4271cf9ffd53a336d.avif?t=1771524089\" width=894 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269660/extras/87a2d63e9ad27bfe9f3b25262c173687.avif?t=1771524089\" width=1560 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can nurture her into a deeply affectionate partner who shares her passion with you, or encourage her playful, adventurous side as she becomes a bold starlet who loves the spotlight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either way, you\u2019ll share every intimate moment, on camera and off...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269660/extras/8f27ae9f44c1d2328939a6ffc0f2b965.poster.avif?t=1771524089\" width=548 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269660/extras/8f27ae9f44c1d2328939a6ffc0f2b965.webm?t=1771524089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269660/extras/8f27ae9f44c1d2328939a6ffc0f2b965.mp4?t=1771524089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Vibrant World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than just a Visual Novel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn XP by snapping photos and completing quests.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take Anna on vacations, unlock stylish new outfits, upgrade your gear, and invest skill points across three unique skill trees. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a variety of fun minigames, from motorbike racing and tower defense to a tabletop-inspired RPG adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269660/extras/f23835de21bcfd6cf49e5503446b4fa6.avif?t=1771524089\" width=1560 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269660/extras/551daa5478413f83a034482e8f76e985.avif?t=1771524089\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269660/extras_big/551daa5478413f83a034482e8f76e985.webp?t=1771524089 width=1560 height=235 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269660/extras/87a2d63e9ad27bfe9f3b25262c173687.avif?t=1771524089\" width=1560 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There's lots of activities in Peak City!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Anna\u2019s Starmaker page and adult career</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Anna during her livestreams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice-driven adult visual novel story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lewd tower defense minigame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tabletop RPG with 20+ unlockable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight evil spirits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kinky motorbike races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gym training</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cryptid hunting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269660/extras/2fd2cf2a43ffcd2398fd48adebb8dc56.poster.avif?t=1771524089\" width=548 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269660/extras/2fd2cf2a43ffcd2398fd48adebb8dc56.webm?t=1771524089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269660/extras/2fd2cf2a43ffcd2398fd48adebb8dc56.mp4?t=1771524089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peak\u00a0City is yours to shape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you claim every beauty for yourself, building a <strong>private harem </st